#Muscat | His Royal Highness Minister of Foreign Affairs Prince #Faisal_bin_Farhan 
@FaisalbinFarhan
 arrives in the sisterly Sultanate of Oman, and he was received by His Excellency the Minister of Foreign Affairs of the Sultanate of Oman, Sayyid Badr bin Hamad bin Hamoud

.
@ADHealthyLiving
 continues its efforts to improve population health via its partnership with the UAE’s Behavioral Science Group, designing initiatives that drive positive behaviour changes.

.
@EADTweets
 has completed an oyster bed mapping survey across Abu Dhabi’s marine waters. The survey, established in 2022 and carried out fieldwork from 2023 to late 2025, covered about 12,000km, reflecting its commitment to advancing marine environmental governance.

The Global Institute for Disease Elimination, in partnership with 
@KhalifaUni
, has concluded the inaugural MENA edition of its Disease Elimination and Eradication Course, gathering health leaders to strengthen regional capacity in eliminating preventable infectious diseases.

.
@atrcuae
 has been appointed the UAE’s 1st national representative of the International Science Council. The appointment strengthens the UAE’s contribution to global scientific dialogue and international policy through one of the world’s foremost and largest coordination bodies
